  "asr_text": "This study cannot tell us that income changed a person's personality or that their personality increased their income. Something else may have played a part in both. Even if researchers follow the same people and take care in how they compare them, that alone cannot prove what caused what. In other words, this is not a how-to guide to a personality that earns more. It is a study that can give you a reason to reopen the book you were about to close, thinking, \"This is just the kind of person I am.\" Rather than ending with, \"That person is the type who earns a lot,\" you can look back and ask, \"How have I changed?\" You may plan to flip through a book about successful people and then realize you're reading the sequel to your own story. That is what makes this study interesting.",
